            "review_title": "Review at Tran Pizza",
            "review_text": "Chăn Q\n1 contribution\n1\nbest wild and weird pizza ever\nNov 2024 • Friends\npicture this: my friend takes a $50 flight just to deliver a $2 pastry (and herself) from Hue to Saigon on a rainy day fit for Noah’s Ark. mission accomplished, she’s starving. Out of 16,000 restaurants (thanks, Statista, Nov 3rd), she craves only one thing: pizza.\n\nwe end up at a cozy spot with vintage Vietnamese plastic chairs, listening to classical jazz as we devour the best pizza in Saigon. It’s Halloween, so the place is decorated 16+ style—think cute ghosts and cobwebs.\n\n10/10 pizza, no regrets. We left soaked but full, with memories as cheesy as the pizza.but \nps: pics are us and for memory only. check out google map for reference :))))\nRead more\nWritten November 3, 2024",
